category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"dIQGbalj-3I8vixZ4M149g","review_id":"zl3Yz4RhLQf88YHi2gBaMA","date":"2019-04-25T16:01:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9493019580841064,"text_excerpt":"Hot damn y'all, this place was just as good as I'd hoped! It came with a really high expectation after falling so in love with Turkey and the Wolf and it really didn't disappoint. More options for me here, and vegetarians in general, so I'll be happy to bring other veg friends here. Met a few of my girls for a quick bite before we all headed to work and not only was the service friendly and fast, but the food was SO BOMB. I like to start my day in Flavortown, and Molly's had my taste buds dancing before I clocked in. I grabbed the sweet potato burrito - been eyeing the menu for a while so I knew exactly what I wanted when I walked in. Paired that with a coffee and a delicious, dreamy, blu..."},{"business_id":"dIQGbalj-3I8vixZ4M149g","review_id":"FGpwYfJK1dV60sOUKeL-sQ","date":"2018-12-09T22:14:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9262343645095825,"text_excerpt":"I loved Molly's! I went a few weeks after it opened so I would have expected it to be a little rough. But everything was running really smoothly when I went. I stopped by with a friend at around noon on a Sunday when I would have expected it to be crazy. There was a pretty long line (there is counter service, then you seat yourself) but it moved relatively quickly. You can fill up your own water (my only complaint about the whole experience - water cups are too tiny!! As are the cups for the orange juice). My friend and I split the Egg McMuffin (very good riff on the classic), the tostada (a ton of complex flavor, probably my favorite dish), the Bagel platter (loved this, just thought the..."},{"business_id":"dIQGbalj-3I8vixZ4M149g","review_id":"dGvsPIHHTaj7DhSrpWgP7w","date":"2019-10-31T01:19:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9261535406112671,"text_excerpt":"I have been hearing about Molly's for some time but have not had the opportunity to go, until now. So glad I did. The decor is simply amazing. Attention to detail perfection. Love the vintage vibe. Go to the counter and place your order. If you are lucky enough to get there early. They have house made pastries. They will give you your trophy with a number on it so they know where to bring your order. Find a seat and wait for the deliciousness to come to you. I had the classic breakfast eggs, sausage, hash brown and a biscuit. My husband had the grand slam Mc Muffin. Both were amazing. Highly recommend you visit. You may have to wait in line but the move through quickly. Enjoy."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dIQGbalj-3I8vixZ4M149g","photo_id":"FTqy3uiJYPEa6l6gx7YacA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FTqy3uiJYPEa6l6gx7YacA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8950167298316956},{"business_id":"dIQGbalj-3I8vixZ4M149g","photo_id":"CCebw2SD-WCGGPwZ2OAXqw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CCebw2SD-WCGGPwZ2OAXqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8587225675582886},{"business_id":"dIQGbalj-3I8vixZ4M149g","photo_id":"GXOXCPgtgKPr9TyJKJq08w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GXOXCPgtgKPr9TyJKJq08w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.856184720993042},{"business_id":"dIQGbalj-3I8vixZ4M149g","photo_id":"El0Nukw0x-x17QKv3sdWqA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/El0Nukw0x-x17QKv3sdWqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.